(7603579, 1228782, 30049, '<td valign="top">One of the few that''s made me pause thus far.  I know there''s a critter in there somewhere, but having a hard time sorting it out, which is good!  :-)</td>', 'One of the few that''s made me pause thus far.  I know there''s a critter in there somewhere, but having a hard time sorting it out, which is good!  :-)', '2018-11-20 20:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
