(7603581, 1228800, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is a tad, um, boring?  Also ... more gray than B&amp;W.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is a tad, um, boring?  Also ... more gray than B&W.', '2018-11-20 20:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
