(7603583, 1228797, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry, just not enough going on here to grab my attention.  I get that it''s water, etc... but need something more extreme in the way of contrast.  Just my opinion of course.</td>', 'Sorry, just not enough going on here to grab my attention.  I get that it''s water, etc... but need something more extreme in the way of contrast.  Just my opinion of course.', '2018-11-20 20:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603732, 1228686, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and textures. My top pick</td>', 'Beautiful tones and textures. My top pick', '2018-11-21 13:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603733, 1228786, 50864, '<td valign="top">Lovely light. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Lovely light. One of my favorites.', '2018-11-21 13:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603734, 1228751, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing</td>', 'Very pleasing', '2018-11-21 13:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603848, 1228768, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this as a B&amp;W image.  IMO not really that abstract, but a nice photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this as a B&W image.  IMO not really that abstract, but a nice photo.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 11:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603849, 1228609, 30049, '<td valign="top">Liking the bg bokeh.  Foreground patterns are interesting.  I must not be abstract savvy as I''m finding many of these not to be that abstract - again IMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'Liking the bg bokeh.  Foreground patterns are interesting.  I must not be abstract savvy as I''m finding many of these not to be that abstract - again IMO.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 11:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603850, 1228777, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yes.  Abstract.  Thanks.  My guess is it''s a reflection on chrome, or something similar.  I like the subject material.  Not so crazy about the upper-right white area.  There is a fair amount of noise in the greys.  Would like to see this with some curve adjustments and noise reduction.  Still ... nice find.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yes.  Abstract.  Thanks.  My guess is it''s a reflection on chrome, or something similar.  I like the subject material.  Not so crazy about the upper-right white area.  There is a fair amount of noise in the greys.  Would like to see this with some curve adjustments and noise reduction.  Still ... nice find.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 11:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603851, 1228317, 30049, '<td valign="top">Definitely abstract.  Now for the holding interest via subject material ... not really getting a good vibe for that.  For example, could I see this in a print and displayed somewhere?  For me, no - however it may totally float your boat.  So ... good luck!</td>', 'Definitely abstract.  Now for the holding interest via subject material ... not really getting a good vibe for that.  For example, could I see this in a print and displayed somewhere?  For me, no - however it may totally float your boat.  So ... good luck!', '2018-11-22 11:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603852, 1228442, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, I really like what you did here with the flip and using the reflections.  Just abstract enough in that regard to make one pause to figure it out.  Front page for this one.  Nice.</td>', 'Oh, I really like what you did here with the flip and using the reflections.  Just abstract enough in that regard to make one pause to figure it out.  Front page for this one.  Nice.', '2018-11-22 11:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603853, 1228445, 30049, '<td valign="top">How is this abstract in any definition of the word?  I''m sure this photo means something to the photographer and perhaps the subject, but big time shoehorn IMO.</td>', 'How is this abstract in any definition of the word?  I''m sure this photo means something to the photographer and perhaps the subject, but big time shoehorn IMO.', '2018-11-22 11:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603854, 1228583, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever comp.  The materials are known but put together in such an interesting way I have to applaud you.  Top pick here.  Hope this makes the front page at rollover.  I especially like the odd, random, arrangement of black voids.</td>', 'Clever comp.  The materials are known but put together in such an interesting way I have to applaud you.  Top pick here.  Hope this makes the front page at rollover.  I especially like the odd, random, arrangement of black voids.', '2018-11-22 11:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603855, 1228671, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would be fun to print and put on a wall, especially on a stucco section.  :-)  I do wish it was sharp into the corners.  Don''t know if it''s the lens falling off or a post choice.  Good luck.</td>', 'This would be fun to print and put on a wall, especially on a stucco section.  :-)  I do wish it was sharp into the corners.  Don''t know if it''s the lens falling off or a post choice.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603856, 1228796, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  I''m struggling to comment on this one.  It''s a B&amp;W pattern.  Interesting in that regard, but not overly compelling as subject material.  Good luck.</td>', 'Sorry.  I''m struggling to comment on this one.  It''s a B&W pattern.  Interesting in that regard, but not overly compelling as subject material.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 11:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
