(7603934, 1228753, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting and clever image.  Not so much abstract IMO, but fun to look at.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting and clever image.  Not so much abstract IMO, but fun to look at.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603935, 1228751, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this as an abstract and the B&amp;W qualities are good.  Don''t particularly care for the post-processing effect.</td>', 'I like this as an abstract and the B&W qualities are good.  Don''t particularly care for the post-processing effect.', '2018-11-22 18:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603936, 1228664, 30049, '<td valign="top">Unique.  Some type of sculpture or ceiling panel?  Maybe a wall?  I like that the pattern in this isn''t predictable.  Nice find, and good luck.</td>', 'Unique.  Some type of sculpture or ceiling panel?  Maybe a wall?  I like that the pattern in this isn''t predictable.  Nice find, and good luck.', '2018-11-22 18:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603937, 1228538, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I would love it if was cropped to not include the upper area with the dark line (looks a bit like a curb).  Good tones in the reflection area.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  I would love it if was cropped to not include the upper area with the dark line (looks a bit like a curb).  Good tones in the reflection area.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 18:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603938, 1228737, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  I know what it is, and I don''t know what it is.  Guessing a reflection / sunlight maybe, from a window or building being cast onto the brick?  Great tonal range and detail.</td>', 'This is fun.  I know what it is, and I don''t know what it is.  Guessing a reflection / sunlight maybe, from a window or building being cast onto the brick?  Great tonal range and detail.', '2018-11-22 18:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603939, 1228488, 30049, '<td valign="top">Abstract?  Sorry, not seeing the connection.</td>', 'Abstract?  Sorry, not seeing the connection.', '2018-11-22 18:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603940, 1228634, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s abstract all right. And it''s B&amp;W certainly.  Has more of a graphic feel to it than a photo at this point with everything being basically OOF.</td>', 'Yep, it''s abstract all right. And it''s B&W certainly.  Has more of a graphic feel to it than a photo at this point with everything being basically OOF.', '2018-11-22 18:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603941, 1228791, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, repeating pattern look to this.  Not quite abstract IMO and the post work is very painterly.</td>', 'Nice texture, repeating pattern look to this.  Not quite abstract IMO and the post work is very painterly.', '2018-11-22 18:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603942, 1228734, 30049, '<td valign="top">I thought we''d see more images like this in the challenge.  Certainly is abstract and I like the flow / lines and comp.  Well played.</td>', 'I thought we''d see more images like this in the challenge.  Certainly is abstract and I like the flow / lines and comp.  Well played.', '2018-11-22 18:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603943, 1228778, 30049, '<td valign="top">The stairs are tricky, like as in ''watch your step''?  It''s "ok".  A little bland subject wise and I wish the contrast was a bit more.  Good luck.</td>', 'The stairs are tricky, like as in ''watch your step''?  It''s "ok".  A little bland subject wise and I wish the contrast was a bit more.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 18:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603944, 1228455, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I like the abstract pattern in the lower 2/3''s of the image.  The upper area doesn''t add much IMO (except to make one scroll down to find the good stuff).  :-)</td>', 'This is interesting.  I like the abstract pattern in the lower 2/3''s of the image.  The upper area doesn''t add much IMO (except to make one scroll down to find the good stuff).  :-)', '2018-11-22 18:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603945, 1228784, 30049, '<td valign="top">If I blur my eyes, it''s abstract.  :-)  I do like the image and find it fun to look at.  Would like a little more on the black end of the scale.  Interesting capture though.  Good luck.</td>', 'If I blur my eyes, it''s abstract.  :-)  I do like the image and find it fun to look at.  Would like a little more on the black end of the scale.  Interesting capture though.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603946, 1228708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Basket weave pattern.  A macro of this may have worked a little stronger from an abstract perspective.  Not sure why you didn''t convert this to B&amp;W.</td>', 'Basket weave pattern.  A macro of this may have worked a little stronger from an abstract perspective.  Not sure why you didn''t convert this to B&W.', '2018-11-22 19:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603947, 1228411, 30049, '<td valign="top">A bit too bland for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'A bit too bland for me.  Sorry.', '2018-11-22 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603948, 1228684, 30049, '<td valign="top">Like the abstract part of it. Wish the blacks were a tad deeper.  Not sure if I like the graphic post effect applied or not.  Interesting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the abstract part of it. Wish the blacks were a tad deeper.  Not sure if I like the graphic post effect applied or not.  Interesting.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603949, 1228429, 30049, '<td valign="top">High-key flower shot (almost).  Pretty grainy in the mid-greys.</td>', 'High-key flower shot (almost).  Pretty grainy in the mid-greys.', '2018-11-22 19:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603950, 1228444, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh!  I like this.  Should be front page news tomorrow!  Not really sure what this is and I like the ''artsy'' feel of it.  Well done.</td>', 'Oh!  I like this.  Should be front page news tomorrow!  Not really sure what this is and I like the ''artsy'' feel of it.  Well done.', '2018-11-22 19:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603952, 1228755, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  Too flat.  Prefer some zing, some contrast, etc... in a B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Sorry.  Too flat.  Prefer some zing, some contrast, etc... in a B&W image.', '2018-11-22 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603953, 1228166, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pondering. Interesting.  Unique.  I like it.</td>', 'Pondering. Interesting.  Unique.  I like it.', '2018-11-22 19:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603956, 1228282, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little dirty, a little grungy ... not crazy about that part, but I do like the undulating wave feel to this.  The possible convoluted metal work that lies behind this snippet caught by the photographer.  Definitely an artsy feel to it, which I think abstract should have.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!</td>', 'A little dirty, a little grungy ... not crazy about that part, but I do like the undulating wave feel to this.  The possible convoluted metal work that lies behind this snippet caught by the photographer.  Definitely an artsy feel to it, which I think abstract should have.  Well seen and captured.  Good luck!', '2018-11-22 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603958, 1228686, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  At a loss here.  Not sure what to think of this one.  Sorry, not grabbing my interest.</td>', 'Hmmm.  At a loss here.  Not sure what to think of this one.  Sorry, not grabbing my interest.', '2018-11-22 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603960, 1228779, 30049, '<td valign="top">Abstract, yep.  B&amp;W, yep.  Maybe a little like a hieroglyphic?  Not sure.  A bit busy, and honestly, not palatable subject material (for me).  Good luck.</td>', 'Abstract, yep.  B&W, yep.  Maybe a little like a hieroglyphic?  Not sure.  A bit busy, and honestly, not palatable subject material (for me).  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603961, 1228466, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, good contrast, interesting ... well done.</td>', 'Clean, good contrast, interesting ... well done.', '2018-11-22 19:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603962, 1228604, 30049, '<td valign="top">Abstract because of their outfits?  Trying to figure the approach to entering this as an ''abstract''.  Nonetheless, interesting scene.  Good luck.</td>', 'Abstract because of their outfits?  Trying to figure the approach to entering this as an ''abstract''.  Nonetheless, interesting scene.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603963, 1228460, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sitting here trying to put some thoughts down and I''m drawing a blank.  I like the globes.  Certainly plenty of contrast.  The overwhelming areas of black are sucking me in like a black hole .... help!  I neeedddd to get to the next phot.......</td>', 'Sitting here trying to put some thoughts down and I''m drawing a blank.  I like the globes.  Certainly plenty of contrast.  The overwhelming areas of black are sucking me in like a black hole .... help!  I neeedddd to get to the next phot.......', '2018-11-22 19:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603964, 1228334, 114285, '<td valign="top">Like ;0)</td>', 'Like ;0)', '2018-11-22 19:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603967, 1228195, 30049, '<td valign="top">Metal wall that''s trying to hide.  I like the pattern.  Good use of angle to throw this off into an abstract feel.  Good luck.</td>', 'Metal wall that''s trying to hide.  I like the pattern.  Good use of angle to throw this off into an abstract feel.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603968, 1228575, 30049, '<td valign="top">What did you do to that poor keyboard?!  :-)  Certainly abstract-ish (in a weird way), and I find it interesting to look at.  One thing I don''t like is the washed out blacks and lack of contrast.  Overall, well done.  Good luck.</td>', 'What did you do to that poor keyboard?!  :-)  Certainly abstract-ish (in a weird way), and I find it interesting to look at.  One thing I don''t like is the washed out blacks and lack of contrast.  Overall, well done.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603969, 1228749, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  One to be proud of for the pattern and focus.  Not sure what happened on the exterior edges - if it was intentional in an attempt to draw the viewer into the center, I thing the center droplet would have been enough.  As for being abstract, that I''m not seeing here.  Just my opinion.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice photo.  One to be proud of for the pattern and focus.  Not sure what happened on the exterior edges - if it was intentional in an attempt to draw the viewer into the center, I thing the center droplet would have been enough.  As for being abstract, that I''m not seeing here.  Just my opinion.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603970, 1228732, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not getting an abstract feel here with this.  Sorry.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not getting an abstract feel here with this.  Sorry.', '2018-11-22 19:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603971, 1228783, 30049, '<td valign="top">"Ok" photo.  Subject material is a bit bland IMO.  Maybe if there was some mysterious object in the corner?  Don''t know.  The thing for me is I don''t see the ''abstract'' connection here.  Sorry, just one guys opinion.  Good luck.</td>', '"Ok" photo.  Subject material is a bit bland IMO.  Maybe if there was some mysterious object in the corner?  Don''t know.  The thing for me is I don''t see the ''abstract'' connection here.  Sorry, just one guys opinion.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
