(7603973, 1228573, 30049, '<td valign="top">I hope that ''Treasure'' didn''t get damaged during the taking of this photo.  :-)  The thing working for me in this is the lower-left black and the upper-right white (although I wish the white was whiter).  Good luck.</td>', 'I hope that ''Treasure'' didn''t get damaged during the taking of this photo.  :-)  The thing working for me in this is the lower-left black and the upper-right white (although I wish the white was whiter).  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603974, 1228111, 30049, '<td valign="top">Abstract?  I mean as a parent this is a cool photo, and many others will find this an intriguing, honest moment (as do I) - just don''t see this image working in this challenge.  My opinion.  Good luck.</td>', 'Abstract?  I mean as a parent this is a cool photo, and many others will find this an intriguing, honest moment (as do I) - just don''t see this image working in this challenge.  My opinion.  Good luck.', '2018-11-22 19:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603975, 1228526, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thought ... I like it.  Interesting pattern and subject.  Has a little ''golden ratio'' going on here and a way of keeping a smooth flow throughout.  Well done.</td>', 'First thought ... I like it.  Interesting pattern and subject.  Has a little ''golden ratio'' going on here and a way of keeping a smooth flow throughout.  Well done.', '2018-11-22 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7603976, 1228062, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok-dokie.  Drawers, yep.  A bit thin on the abstract feel IMO.  I do like the light streak coming in from the upper-left.</td>', 'Ok-dokie.  Drawers, yep.  A bit thin on the abstract feel IMO.  I do like the light streak coming in from the upper-left.', '2018-11-22 19:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
